Let's explore possibilities for a performance review mechanism that harmonizes the stringency of your proposed monitoring with our flexible implementation perspective. This can foster accountability without compromising on developmental opportunities for emerging economies.

India looks forward to closely collaborating with the EU to forge an effective, equitable climate change policy.

Thank you.




